WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.100
It was the first time...

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.030
The first time I was able to
tell someone how I truly felt.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.910
You were the first, Hanayo-san.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.160
Yuzuki...

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.160
Thank you...

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.000
Hanayo-san.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:49.440
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:54.950
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:59.740
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:03.710
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.960
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:13.010
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:16.260
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:21.350
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.640
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.400
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.490
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:42.830
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:49.040
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:53.800
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:07.770
Ruu-chan, you'll be late if you don't leave for school now, won't you?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.770
Oh no!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.770
I'll do the rest of the dishes.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.980
Thanks!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.340
Morning, Ruu!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.260
Morning, Tama.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.640
Is it school time already?

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.390
You're such a sleepy-head, Tama.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.460
S-Sorry, Yuzuki!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.090
I'm leaving!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.300
Good morning!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.840
My, you're alone today? Where's Yuzuki-chan?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.510
Huh? Oh, um, nothing...

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.150
Is Akira still missing?

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:44.450
Yeah. A girl from her school said so.
She hasn't gone home at all.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.700
It's already been a week or so, right?

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.340
Ruu, the train's going to go! Ruu?!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.110
Yuzuki...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.570
<i>Right, we're...</i>

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.240
<i>Let's not be friends anymore.</i>

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.700
<i>We're not friends anymore.</i>

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.660
<i>I won't battle anymore.</i>

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.130
<i>And Yuzuki won't stop battling until her wish comes true.</i>

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.170
<i>That's what we decided.</i>

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.630
<i>Yes... that's what we decided.</i>

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.140
You serious?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.770
Yeah, the Kurebayashis in second year...

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.980
You mean the twins?

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.980
I heard they're dating even though they're brother and sister!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.400
Wait, isn't that ince—

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.650
No way!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.320
Whoa, so the rumor is true?

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.160
Think they did it already?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.530
Well, they <i>do</i> live together.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.660
Damn...

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.490
It's not your fault, Honoka.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.660
You really shouldn't worry about it.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.620
And I thought he was cool...

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.830
Gross...

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.220
Did you spread it to everyone?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.840
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.930
It's your fault for doing something people would talk about.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:33.770
A-All I said was that you were acting strange.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.060
I just asked what everyone thought...

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.730
Honoka was worried about you, you know!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:43.190
I felt sorry that you and Yuzuki-san were being misunderstood.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.450
Say what you want about me, but I won't
forgive anyone who insults Yuzuki!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.330
Y-You won't forgive me? That's awful!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.830
You're the worst...

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.120
That's why everyone is saying
you two are getting it on and stuff.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.250
Apologize to her!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.620
You're a total loser.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.460
It's your own fault anyway.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.670
Aren't they brother and sister?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.590
I <i>told</i> you it's crazy!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.050
Now I feel bad thinking she was cute...

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.770
There you are.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.110
Yuzuki.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:26.860
I heard you told the others not to insult me.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.280
Yeah...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.410
That makes me happy. But you don't have to worry.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.000
After all, it <i>is</i> true.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.250
What do you mean by that?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.460
I...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.630
love you, Kazuki.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.840
I've loved you ever since we were kids.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:53.390
But I believed telling you that would make you hate me.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.480
That's what I thought for the longest time.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.520
<i>Goto-kun in class two, I guess...?</i>

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.190
<i>He's not bad!</i>

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.560
<i>You really think so?</i>

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.240
As I got older, all the girls
around me had boys they liked.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.070
<i>Hey, Yuzuki, how about you?</i>

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.780
<i>We all said who we liked,
so now it's your turn!</i>

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.160
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.500
<i>I-I'm not really interested in boys...</i>

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.710
<i>Aww, you're lying!</i>

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:26.210
<i>It's true! There's totally no one I like.</i>

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.380
<i>You're </i>lying<i>!</i>

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.760
<i>No, it's really true!</i>

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.050
<i>Come on now!</i>

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.380
<i>But it's really true...</i>

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.720
I couldn't tell anyone the truth.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:40.100
<i>Um, do you... do you know if...
if Kazuki-kun has a girl he likes?</i>

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:45.610
<i>H-He was saying he thinks that's kinda creepy.</i>

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:51.490
<i>And you know, when he watches romance shows on TV,
he says they're totally made-up and boring.</i>

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.820
I lied to my friends.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.910
I lied to you, the person I love.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:03.000
But I thought it was better that way.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.260
<i>What? You're fine with how things are?</i>

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.720
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.090
<i>I'll still love Kazuki forever.</i>

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.890
<i>Even when he gets a girlfriend, marries, and has kids...</i>

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.230
<i>I'll keep this lie up as long as I live.</i>

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:29.150
<i>Even when I'm old and alone,
I'll love him until the day I die.</i>

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.950
But on that day...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.660
<i>A card game?</i>

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.830
<i>It's pretty fun.</i>

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.290
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.800
<i>Are you my Selector?</i>

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.760
<i>I'm Hanayo. Nice to meet you!</i>

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.640
<i>The card... talked?!</i>

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.600
<i>The card did what?</i>

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.060
<i>You can't hear her, Kazuki? This card just...</i>

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.110
<i>Don't bother.</i>

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.230
<i>Only Selectors can hear our voices.</i>

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.240
<i>S-Selector...?</i>

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.870
<i>My wish can come true?</i>

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.000
<i>Right. Whether you believe that or not is up to you.</i>

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.210
<i>You have a wish, right?</i>

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.760
<i>You've got nothing to lose. Go ahead and tell me.</i>

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.800
<i>I... love Kazu...</i>

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:38.340
<i>What?</i>

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.310
<i>I... love Kazuki.</i>

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.980
<i>Kazuki? You mean your brother?</i>

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:58.240
<i>I love Kazuki... I love Kazuki...</i>

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.870
<i>I love...</i>

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:04.200
<i>I love Kazuki! I love him... I love him...</i>

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.460
<i>I love him!</i>

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.040
<i>I know this isn't right...</i>

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.960
<i>I know it'll never be allowed!</i>

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.420
<i>But I want to be with him!
I want to be with Kazuki forever!</i>

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.430
<i>No... I want to be Kazuki's...</i>

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.720
<i>I want to be his girlfriend!</i>

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.730
<i>All right, let's make it happen.</i>

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.730
<i>We'll make that wish come true.</i>

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.650
So your wish was...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.990
I was really doing my best...

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.830
being straightforward.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.210
Straightforward in my efforts.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.420
Straightforward in being hurt.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.250
Straightforward in hurting others.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.550
It was the first time...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:02.220
The first time I was able to
tell someone how I truly felt.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:05.180
You were the first, Hanayo-san.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.480
Yuzuki...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.100
Thank you... Hanayo-san.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.900
As long as I get to be with you,

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.320
I didn't care if I'd get hurt,

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.370
if the entire world were against me,

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.120
or if I'd lose everything else in the process.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.870
I love you, Kazuki.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.350
Kazuki?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.100
He hasn't been back since lunch.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.730
Thanks.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:56.980
She's here...

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.610
Pretty creepy...

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.540
<i>A wish...</i>

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.670
<i>A wish you want to make come true,</i>

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:20.550
<i>even if it means hurting yourself or hurting someone else.</i>

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.340
<i>Next time we meet, I'll be a new Yuzuki!</i>

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.680
<i>I'll be Kazuki's girlfriend!</i>

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:33.640
<i>A feeling as straightforward as hers can't be numbed.</i>

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.910
<i>I don't have a wish.</i>

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.370
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.250
<i>That's what we are about.</i>

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.670
<i>Me...</i>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.040
<i>and you.</i>

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.800
No...

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.840
I'm...

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.680
Ruu?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.930
Are you lonely, Ruu?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.060
Because Hitoe and Yuzuki
aren't your friends anymore?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.480
But Tama is still your friend!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:21.900
Battle...

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:27.240
Even if we don't battle... we'll always be friends!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:29.490
Tama...

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.700
I really like having battles...

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.000
But I can stop!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.500
Thanks, Tama.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.590
Ruu!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.590
Excuse me...

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.180
Hitoe?!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:54.680
Hitoe, why are you...

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.730
Does that mean you remember me now?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:58.690
Ruu!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.440
Hitoe has a LRIG!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.530
LRIG?

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.490
You're... a Selector, right?

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.240
Please battle me.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:17.660
It can't be... You've become a Selector again?!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.340
Please battle me.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.630
No...

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.760
No—why?

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:33.720
I'm sorry... I'm not battling anymore.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.020
So you say, but you're still taking Tama with you.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.440
Yuzuki?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:42.560
Guess that can't be helped, though.
You guys are really close after all.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:43.820
Yuzuki?!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:49.700
That said, why not do a favor for a former friend of yours?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.700
Where are you, Yuzuki?!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.000
Yuzuki...

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:10.130
Long time no see! Well, not really, I guess.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:14.140
You're... a LRIG?

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.430
This can't be real...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.640
It can't... that can't be...

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.690
It's very much real.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:25.820
That scrunchie!

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.570
Looks like the three of us have met again.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.280
It feels pretty weird, though.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.620
Yuzuki...

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.450
What happened?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:38.660
Well, there's a lot to talk about,

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.960
but before that...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.830
Battle Hitoe.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.090
I can't! I can't do that!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.590
It's for Hitoe's sake.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.050
It's for Hitoe's wish, and for me.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.140
My wish...

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.060
Please, Ruuko.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:01.020
For Hitoe and you?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:18.660
Okay.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.330
Thank you.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.210
Open!
Open!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.640
Hitoe... Yuzuki...

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.570
Tama! Grow!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:52.070
Okay!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.740
Tell me, Yuzuki! What happened?!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.670
I won my battle.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.630
And my wish was approved.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:14.010
<i>Your final attack, and your final oath.
We'll say it together.</i>

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.440
<i>Now, let's say it together.</i>

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>I accept...</i>

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.280
<i>I... accept!</i>

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>the Laws of the Selector.</i>

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.950
<i>The Laws of the Selector.</i>

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:36.780
<i>And now!</i>

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:40.780
<i>A new Eternal Girl will be born!
A new Eternal Girl will be born!</i>

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.330
<i>Adamasphere!
Adamasphere!</i>

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.300
No Entry
No Entry

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.190
Then the Yuzuki now is...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:16.950
<i>Yuzuki...</i>

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.120
Hanayo-san... became Yuzuki?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:26.870
When a girl's wish is approved, she becomes an Eternal Girl

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.750
and gains the power to make wishes come true.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.290
But...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.380
the one granting the wish...

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.530
It's the drawing I made in pre-school.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.240
I'm the princess.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.200
The black scribble next to her...
You know who that is?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.960
You were the prince in this drawing.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.250
Because I wanted to be your bride.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:16.250
But they told me that was a bad thing.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.260
I tried to blot it out, again and again.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.470
I painted it over as thoroughly as I could.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.850
But it didn't work.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.690
"Blot it out"...

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.610
I... I couldn't blot out my feelings, either.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.200
I love you too.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:48.200
I... I love you too, Yuzuki. I love you!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.250
I've loved you for so long...

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:55.880
I know we're family. I knew it wouldn't be allowed.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.670
I lied to myself all this time.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.090
I tried not to notice my feelings!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:07.560
But I don't care what happens anymore. I don't care what the others think!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:12.140
I don't mind losing everything and leaving
everyone else behind as long as we're together!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.940
I love you, Yuzuki! I love you! I love you!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:25.120
I... love you too, Kazuki.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:27.830
Finally.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.950
The wish...

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.250
came true.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.040
That... that can't be!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.010
The LRIG... grants the wish?

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.220
You...

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.350
will become a LRIG.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:11.500
The replaced Selector becomes another girl's LRIG.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.420
<i>Nice to meet you, Selector.</i>

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:28.140
Only when you lead that girl to victory and once again change places

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.140
will you be able to return to the outside world.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.850
So the wish does come true.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:40.610
But the one who granted it wasn't me, the Selector,

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.780
but Hanayo-san, the LRIG.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.990
That's the Eternal Girl.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.240
That's...

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.280
the truth behind these battles.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:55.040
That
Truth
is
Cruel

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:26.460
Hanayo-san...

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.300
I don't know anything!

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:29.510
Hanayo-san...

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:30.970
I don't know...

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:33.090
Hanayo-san... you're terrible!

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:34.260
I don't know!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:37.350
Hanayo-san... thank you.

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:40.020
That
Emotion
is
Stranded
That emotion is stranded.

